{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\tNvidia公布，董事會一致通過恢復黃仁勳行政總裁職務，即時生效。<br/>\n<br/>\n集團指，經過與黃仁勳進行一系列討論與會面，董事會對黃仁勳的坦誠態度及領導能力感到滿意，同時董事會亦聽取美國政府高層的意見，有信心黃仁勳復職不會構成國家安全風險。<br/>\n<br/>\n消息公布後，Nvidia在美股盤前交易曾急升29%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅煒皓\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.380007+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:02:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:57:36.428337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:35.759299+00:00","content_hash":"2b82bee54654d0c029e306604b6e9d596657f25369d66c9bfa89bdd1c15b2409","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}